      "title": "Angle rules",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Angles on a <span class=\"ul-b\">straight line</span> add up to <span class=\"ul-k\">180&deg;</span>. Angles at a <span class=\"ul-b\">point</span> add up to <span class=\"ul-k\">360&deg;</span>."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "<span class=\"rb\">Vertically opposite:</span> When two lines cross, the opposite angles are equal."
        }
      ]
    },
